{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":40,"entries":[{"id":19942,"title":"Jeremiah 40:1","segments":["¶The word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD, after that Nebuzaradan the captain of the guard had let him go from Ramah, when he had taken him being bound in chains among all that were carried away captive of Jerusalem and Judah, which were carried away captive unto Babylon. {chains: or, manicles}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶The word","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" that came to Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":" from the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" that Nebuzaradan","strong":"H5018"},{"text":" the captain","strong":"H7227"},{"text":" of the guard","strong":"H2876"},{"text":" had let him go","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" from Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":", when he had taken","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" him being bound","strong":"H631"},{"text":" in chains","strong":"H246"},{"text":" among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" all that were carried away captive","strong":"H1546"},{"text":" of Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":" and Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", which were carried away captive","strong":"H1540"},{"text":" unto Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":". {chains: or, manicles}"}]},{"id":19943,"title":"Jeremiah 40:2","segments":["And the captain of the guard took Jeremiah, and said unto him, The LORD thy God hath pronounced this evil upon this place."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And the captain","strong":"H7227"},{"text":" of the guard","strong":"H2876"},{"text":" took","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, The LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" thy God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" hath pronounced","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" this evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" upon this place","strong":"H4725"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19944,"title":"Jeremiah 40:3","segments":["Now the LORD hath brought [it], and done according as he hath said: because ye have sinned against the LORD, and have not obeyed his voice, therefore this thing is come upon you."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"Now the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" hath brought","strong":"H935"},{"text":" [it], and done","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" according as he hath said","strong":"H1696"},{"text":": because ye have sinned","strong":"H2398"},{"text":" against the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", and have not obeyed","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" his voice","strong":"H6963"},{"text":", therefore this thing","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" is come upon you."}]},{"id":19945,"title":"Jeremiah 40:4","segments":["And now, behold, I loose thee this day from the chains which [were] upon thine hand. If it seem good unto thee to come with me into Babylon, come; and I will look well unto thee: but if it seem ill unto thee to come with me into Babylon, forbear: behold, all the land [is] before thee: whither it seemeth good and convenient for thee to go, thither go. {were...: or, are upon thine hand} {I will...: Heb. I will set mine eye upon thee}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:4","verse":4,"words":[{"text":"And now, behold, I loose","strong":"H6605"},{"text":" thee this day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" from the chains","strong":"H246"},{"text":" which [were] upon thine hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":". If it seem good","strong":"H2896"},{"text":"","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" unto thee to come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" with me into Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", come","strong":"H935"},{"text":"; and I will look well","strong":"H7760"},{"text":"","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" unto thee: but if it seem ill","strong":"H7489"},{"text":"","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" unto thee to come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" with me into Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", forbear","strong":"H2308"},{"text":": behold","strong":"H7200"},{"text":", all the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" [is] before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" thee: whither it seemeth","strong":"H413"},{"text":" good","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" and convenient","strong":"H3477"},{"text":"","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" for thee to go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":", thither go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":". {were...: or, are upon thine hand} {I will...: Heb. I will set mine eye upon thee}"}]},{"id":19946,"title":"Jeremiah 40:5","segments":["Now while he was not yet gone back, [he said], Go back also to Gedaliah the son of Ahikam the son of Shaphan, whom the king of Babylon hath made governor over the cities of Judah, and dwell with him among the people: or go wheresoever it seemeth convenient unto thee to go. So the captain of the guard gave him victuals and a reward, and let him go."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:5","verse":5,"words":[{"text":"Now while he was not yet gone back","strong":"H7725"},{"text":", [he said], Go back","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" also to Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Shaphan","strong":"H8227"},{"text":", whom the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":" hath made governor","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" over the cities","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", and dwell","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" with him among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":": or go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" wheresoever it seemeth convenient","strong":"H3477"},{"text":"","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" unto thee to go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":". So the captain","strong":"H7227"},{"text":" of the guard","strong":"H2876"},{"text":" gave","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" him victuals","strong":"H737"},{"text":" and a reward","strong":"H4864"},{"text":", and let him go","strong":"H7971"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19947,"title":"Jeremiah 40:6","segments":["Then went Jeremiah unto Gedaliah the son of Ahikam to Mizpah; and dwelt with him among the people that were left in the land."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:6","verse":6,"words":[{"text":"Then went","strong":"H935"},{"text":" Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":" unto Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" to Mizpah","strong":"H4708"},{"text":"; and dwelt","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" with him among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" that were left","strong":"H7604"},{"text":" in the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19948,"title":"Jeremiah 40:7","segments":["¶Now when all the captains of the forces which [were] in the fields, [even] they and their men, heard that the king of Babylon had made Gedaliah the son of Ahikam governor in the land, and had committed unto him men, and women, and children, and of the poor of the land, of them that were not carried away captive to Babylon;"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"¶Now when all the captains","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of the forces","strong":"H2428"},{"text":" which [were] in the fields","strong":"H7704"},{"text":", [even] they and their men","strong":"H582"},{"text":", heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" that the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":" had made Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" governor","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" in the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", and had committed","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" unto him men","strong":"H582"},{"text":", and women","strong":"H802"},{"text":", and children","strong":"H2945"},{"text":", and of the poor","strong":"H1803"},{"text":" of the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", of them that were not carried away captive","strong":"H1540"},{"text":" to Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":";"}]},{"id":19949,"title":"Jeremiah 40:8","segments":["Then they came to Gedaliah to Mizpah, even Ishmael the son of Nethaniah, and Johanan and Jonathan the sons of Kareah, and Seraiah the son of Tanhumeth, and the sons of Ephai the Netophathite, and Jezaniah the son of a Maachathite, they and their men."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"Then they came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" to Mizpah","strong":"H4708"},{"text":", even Ishmael","strong":"H3458"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Nethaniah","strong":"H5418"},{"text":", and Johanan","strong":"H3110"},{"text":" and Jonathan","strong":"H3129"},{"text":" the sons","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Kareah","strong":"H7143"},{"text":", and Seraiah","strong":"H8304"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Tanhumeth","strong":"H8576"},{"text":", and the sons","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ephai","strong":"H5778"},{"text":" the Netophathite","strong":"H5200"},{"text":", and Jezaniah","strong":"H3153"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of a Maachathite","strong":"H4602"},{"text":", they and their men","strong":"H582"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19950,"title":"Jeremiah 40:9","segments":["And Gedaliah the son of Ahikam the son of Shaphan sware unto them and to their men, saying, Fear not to serve the Chaldeans: dwell in the land, and serve the king of Babylon, and it shall be well with you."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"And Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Shaphan","strong":"H8227"},{"text":" sware","strong":"H7650"},{"text":" unto them and to their men","strong":"H582"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Fear","strong":"H3372"},{"text":" not to serve","strong":"H5647"},{"text":" the Chaldeans","strong":"H3778"},{"text":": dwell in","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", and serve","strong":"H5647"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", and it shall be well","strong":"H3190"},{"text":" with you."}]},{"id":19951,"title":"Jeremiah 40:10","segments":["As for me, behold, I will dwell at Mizpah to serve the Chaldeans, which will come unto us: but ye, gather ye wine, and summer fruits, and oil, and put [them] in your vessels, and dwell in your cities that ye have taken. {to serve: Heb. to stand before}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"As for me, behold, I will dwell","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" at Mizpah","strong":"H4709"},{"text":" to serve","strong":"H5975"},{"text":"","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the Chaldeans","strong":"H3778"},{"text":", which will come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" unto us: but ye, gather","strong":"H622"},{"text":" ye wine","strong":"H3196"},{"text":", and summer fruits","strong":"H7019"},{"text":", and oil","strong":"H8081"},{"text":", and put","strong":"H7760"},{"text":" [them] in your vessels","strong":"H3627"},{"text":", and dwell","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" in your cities","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" that ye have taken","strong":"H8610"},{"text":". {to serve: Heb. to stand before}"}]},{"id":19952,"title":"Jeremiah 40:11","segments":["Likewise when all the Jews that [were] in Moab, and among the Ammonites, and in Edom, and that [were] in all the countries, heard that the king of Babylon had left a remnant of Judah, and that he had set over them Gedaliah the son of Ahikam the son of Shaphan;"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"Likewise when all the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":" that [were] in Moab","strong":"H4124"},{"text":", and among the Ammonites","strong":"H5983"},{"text":", and in Edom","strong":"H123"},{"text":", and that [were] in all the countries","strong":"H776"},{"text":", heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" that the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":" had left","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" a remnant","strong":"H7611"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", and that he had set","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" over them Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Shaphan","strong":"H8227"},{"text":";"}]},{"id":19953,"title":"Jeremiah 40:12","segments":["Even all the Jews returned out of all places whither they were driven, and came to the land of Judah, to Gedaliah, unto Mizpah, and gathered wine and summer fruits very much."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"Even all the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":" returned out","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" of all places","strong":"H4725"},{"text":" whither they were driven","strong":"H5080"},{"text":", and came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", to Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":", unto Mizpah","strong":"H4708"},{"text":", and gathered","strong":"H622"},{"text":" wine","strong":"H3196"},{"text":" and summer fruits","strong":"H7019"},{"text":" very","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" much","strong":"H7235"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19954,"title":"Jeremiah 40:13","segments":["Moreover Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the captains of the forces that [were] in the fields, came to Gedaliah to Mizpah,"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"Moreover Johanan","strong":"H3110"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Kareah","strong":"H7143"},{"text":", and all the captains","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of the forces","strong":"H2428"},{"text":" that [were] in the fields","strong":"H7704"},{"text":", came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" to Mizpah","strong":"H4708"},{"text":","}]},{"id":19955,"title":"Jeremiah 40:14","segments":["And said unto him, Dost thou certainly know that Baalis the king of the Ammonites hath sent Ishmael the son of Nethaniah to slay thee? But Gedaliah the son of Ahikam believed them not. {to slay...: Heb. to strike thee in soul?}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"And said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, Dost thou certainly","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" know","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" that Baalis","strong":"H1185"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of the Ammonites","strong":"H1121"},{"text":"","strong":"H5983"},{"text":" hath sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" Ishmael","strong":"H3458"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Nethaniah","strong":"H5418"},{"text":" to slay","strong":"H5221"},{"text":"","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" thee? But Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" believed","strong":"H539"},{"text":" them not. {to slay...: Heb. to strike thee in soul?}"}]},{"id":19956,"title":"Jeremiah 40:15","segments":["Then Johanan the son of Kareah spake to Gedaliah in Mizpah secretly, saying, Let me go, I pray thee, and I will slay Ishmael the son of Nethaniah, and no man shall know [it]: wherefore should he slay thee, that all the Jews which are gathered unto thee should be scattered, and the remnant in Judah perish?"],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"Then Johanan","strong":"H3110"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Kareah","strong":"H7143"},{"text":" spake","strong":"H559"},{"text":" to Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" in Mizpah","strong":"H4709"},{"text":" secretly","strong":"H5643"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Let me go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":", I pray thee, and I will slay","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" Ishmael","strong":"H3458"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Nethaniah","strong":"H5418"},{"text":", and no man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" shall know","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" [it]: wherefore should he slay","strong":"H5221"},{"text":"","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" thee, that all the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":" which are gathered","strong":"H6908"},{"text":" unto thee should be scattered","strong":"H6327"},{"text":", and the remnant","strong":"H7611"},{"text":" in Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":" perish","strong":"H6"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":19957,"title":"Jeremiah 40:16","segments":["But Gedaliah the son of Ahikam said unto Johanan the son of Kareah, Thou shalt not do this thing: for thou speakest falsely of Ishmael."],"ref":"Jeremiah 40:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"But Gedaliah","strong":"H1436"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ahikam","strong":"H296"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Johanan","strong":"H3110"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Kareah","strong":"H7143"},{"text":", Thou shalt not do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" this thing","strong":"H1697"},{"text":": for thou speakest","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" falsely","strong":"H8267"},{"text":" of Ishmael","strong":"H3458"},{"text":"."}]}]}
